  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Sudan 2025 &#x2013; UNHCR MHPSS Technical Working Group Specialist</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this deployment is to provide technical MHPSS expertise in Port Sudan (Sudan). This includes capacity strengthening to facilitate effective coordination, mapping of MHPSS services and facilitate MHPSS trainings based on need identified.Due to visa constraints, it was not possible for the expert to travel to Port Sudan. Therefore, the expert had to work remotely and activities of the Terms of Reference (ToR) could not be completed. To be able to support the Sudan response, it was eventually decided to deploy the expert in Chad, in the border region with Sudan.The purpose of the deployment in Iriba (Chad) is to provide technical MHPSS expertise. This includes capacity strengthening to facilitate effective coordination, mapping of MHPSS services and facilitate MHPSS trainings based on need identified.</narrative>
  </description>
